{
  "case_goal": "Add a time tracking entry for a project in Collabtive",
  "summary": "Login to Collabtive, navigate to project 'test', open time tracker form, fill in date (14.03.2024), start time (09:00), end time (12:00), add comment 'test' in the rich text editor, select task option 2, and submit the time entry.",
